        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium profile, uncoated, SZFF 2014, recycling share 52%, with resource correction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium profile, uncoated, SZFF 2014, recycling share 52%, with resource correction
The shares of primary and secondary aluminium used in the production of aluminium profiles are based on a survey among the producers supplying the Swiss market. The extrusion process is modelled with data from ecoinvent v2.;
UUID: a217ddbd-9cc1-3475-a7d6-2dbe779de416
This dataset includes the production of aluminium profiles by using the specific mix for aluminium profiles supplied to the Swiss market in 2014. A resource correction for the share of primary aluminium is also included.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Aluminium industry survey 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a217ddbd-9cc1-3475-a7d6-2dbe779de416.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
